From cb975b3a72c91db7b788e6f33838cd242f061e70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kumar Ankit <186563577+krank-09@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:47:19 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] fix: complete, saved audit explanations shown only beside
 the signed record

Flash models spent the output budget on thinking, cutting explanations off; thinking is now off for flash models, the limit is higher, and a truncated answer (finishReason != STOP) is reported and never saved. Explanations are saved to data/audit_explanations.json (HEDWIG_EXPLANATIONS overrides), survive restarts and are served without calling Gemini again, even with no key. The Explain button now appears only beside 'Signed audit record' on the verifier terminals, not in the admin feed or incident list.
